; Check whether Willy has reached the toilet
;
; Called by #R$89AD every frame while the ending stage #R$85DF is 2 (Willy is
; running to the toilet). In the Bathroom (room $21) with Willy's attribute
; address at $5DBC (low byte $BC: row 13, column 28, where the toilet is
; drawn by #R$959A) it zeroes the frame counter #R$85CB (so the toilet
; animation starts from frame 0) and sets the stage to 3, which freezes
; Willy there.
; .
; Observed: Willy runs right from the Master Bedroom through the Top Landing
; to the Bathroom and the stage changes from 2 to 3 at $9596 (frame 1063 of
; the run in finding F65).
@label=CheckToiletReached
c$9584 LD A,($8420)  ; current room
@isub=CP ROOM_BATHROOM
 $9587 CP $21        ;
 $9589 RET NZ        ;
 $958A LD A,($85D3)  ; low byte of Willy's attribute address
@isub=CP TOILET_ATTR_LOW
 $958D CP $BC        ; only the low byte is compared
 $958F RET NZ        ;
 $9590 XOR A         ;
 $9591 LD ($85CB),A  ;
@isub=LD A,STAGE_AT_TOILET
 $9594 LD A,$03      ;
 $9596 LD ($85DF),A  ; Willy stops
 $9599 RET           ;
